This document demonstrates Typstify's support for Typst documents.

== Introduction

Typst is a new markup-based typesetting system.

== Features

=== Mathematics

Typstify renders Typst math as HTML:

$ integral_0^infinity e^(-x^2) dif x = sqrt(pi) / 2 $

